cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below.
title: "Chatbot and analysis code for: The system's shadow"
abstract: >-
  Chatbot application and analysis code for a laboratory experiment on how AI persona
  affects stress, dialogue behavior, and work quality: the two persona system prompts,
  the Streamlit chat interface that delivered them, the psychophysiological
  signal-processing and event-related analysis pipeline, the LLM dialogue-coding
  pipeline, and the statistical analysis and figure scripts.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
